# UnsignedInteger64 subtraction of large values

Verifies uint subtraction of large values staying inside the unsigned range
through the complete CLI pipeline.

>>> source
const left: uint = 7000000000000000000
const right: uint = 5000000000000000000

const large_diff: uint = left - right
print(large_diff)

<<< stdout
2000000000000000000

<<< stderr
